cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated preprint and dataset."
title: "3D spheroid model context reprograms the druggable proteome axis in lung adenocarcinoma cells"
abstract: >-
  Reprocessing of Calu-3 lung adenocarcinoma proteomics comparing 2D monolayer
  and 3D Matrigel-embedded spheroid culture, identifying a coordinated, druggable,
  prognostic sterol-biosynthesis / surface-receptor / adhesion expression axis
  that is switched off in 3D. Repository holds analysis code, derived data tables,
  metadata and reporting-standards documentation.
